# The repository root doubles as a scratch area for DSP experiments, generated
# code, reports and screenshots. Nothing there is part of the project, and some
# names contain characters Windows forbids (`:`), which breaks checkout there.
# Track deliberately with `git add -f` if something graduates into the project.
